{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 12 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">去噪与图像恢复：残差、盲点与长程建模的假设边界</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Denoising &amp; Restoration</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_053_noise2noise-title\">Noise2Noise</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">使用同一信号的两次独立无偏噪声实现进行 noisy-to-noisy 监督，训练阶段不需要干净靶图。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Trains a denoising network using pairs of independent noisy realizations (y_1, y_2) of the same underlying anatomy without ever observing clean ground truth.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">同一潜在图像 x 的两次独立含噪观测 y1、y2</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Two independent noisy observations (y_1, y_2) of the exact same underlying clean signal x</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">以单次含噪观测为输入的条件均值估计 x_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Clean conditional expectation estimate x̂ = f_θ(y_1)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Official repository network.py, lines 59–114 · PDF p.Repository source lines 59–114</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">官方原始网络配置</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://github.com/NVlabs/noise2noise/blob/7355519e7bfc49e0606cca8867748e736431244b/network.py#L59-L114\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_053_noise2noise')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_053_noise2noise')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Noise2Noise original paper architecture figure, Official repository network.py, lines 59–114\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/5a7ab8e40084ca78ccfb.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Official repository network.py, lines 59–114 · PDF p.Repository source lines 59–114</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_053_noise2noise', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_053_noise2noise\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_053_noise2noise')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_053_noise2noise', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_053_noise2noise\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">潜在图像 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">训练时不可见；两次采集共享同一真实信号</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests two independent noisy observations (y_1, y_2) of the exact same underlying clean signal x and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"训练时不可见；两次采集共享同一真实信号\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests two independent noisy observations (y_1, y_2) of the exact same underlying clean signal x and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"潜在图像 x\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_053_noise2noise', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">潜在图像 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练时不可见；两次采集共享同一真实信号</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests two independent noisy observations (y_1, y_2) of the exact same underlying clean signal x and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"与 n2 条件独立且 E[n1|x]=0\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes noise n1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"噪声 n1\" data-node-name-en=\"noise n1\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_053_noise2noise', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">噪声 n1</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise n1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">与 n2 条件独立且 E[n1|x]=0</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes noise n1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"独立、条件无偏的第二次噪声实现\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs noise n2 within the core paired noisy self supervision computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"噪声 n2\" data-node-name-en=\"noise n2\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_053_noise2noise', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">噪声 n2</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise n2</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">独立、条件无偏的第二次噪声实现</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs noise n2 within the core paired noisy self supervision computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"y1=x+n1\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs input y1 within the core paired noisy self supervision computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"输入 y1\" data-node-name-en=\"input y1\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_053_noise2noise', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入 y1</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input y1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">y1=x+n1</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs input y1 within the core paired noisy self supervision computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"f_theta(y1)，架构可为 U-Net/CNN\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 05 within the core paired noisy self supervision computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"恢复网络\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 05\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_053_noise2noise', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">恢复网络</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 05</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">f_theta(y1)，架构可为 U-Net/CNN</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 05 within the core paired noisy self supervision computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"y2=x+n2，不要求 clean target\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs objective y2 within the core paired noisy self supervision computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"目标 y2\" data-node-name-en=\"objective y2\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_053_noise2noise', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">目标 y2</span><span class=\"lang-en\">objective y2</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">y2=x+n2，不要求 clean target</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs objective y2 within the core paired noisy self supervision computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"最小化 ||f_theta(y1)-y2||^2；总体最优为条件均值\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies N2N loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"N2N 损失\" data-node-name-en=\"N2N loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_053_noise2noise', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">N2N 损失</span><span class=\"lang-en\">N2N loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">最小化 ||f_theta(y1)-y2||^2；总体最优为条件均值</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies N2N loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"推理时只需一个 noisy input\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces clean conditional expectation estimate x̂ = f_θ(y_1) via x_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"x_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x_hat\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_053_noise2noise', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">推理时只需一个 noisy input</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces clean conditional expectation estimate x̂ = f_θ(y_1) via x_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Noise2Noise Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 无偏独立噪声对的监督等价目标</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Equivalence of Expected L2 Risk Under Independent Zero-Mean Noisy Targets E[y_2|x] = x</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Noise2Noise：核心公式 · 无偏独立噪声对的监督等价目标\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"53\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"15.508734pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.593865 -69.000129 258.689376 15.508734\" width=\"258.689376pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.158951-1.659233V-2.064984H.449225V-1.659233H4.158951Z\" id=\"m053_g8-0\"></path><path d=\"M2.963434-2.420017C2.963434-2.543191 2.861996-2.673611 2.731576-2.673611C2.564928-2.673611 1.970792-2.079476 1.760671-1.956301C1.760671-2.362052 1.963547-2.767804 1.963547-3.014153C1.963547-3.166309 1.862109-3.260502 1.709952-3.260502C1.565041-3.260502 1.478094-3.159064 1.