" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"46.795299\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g11-107\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"51.278485\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g21-50\" y=\"-64.102131\"></use><use x=\"51.278485\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g21-50\" y=\"-56.961428\"></use><use x=\"55.612232\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g5-3\" y=\"-68.107101\"></use><use x=\"61.486748\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g17-150\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"76.108527\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g17-72\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"82.021354\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g14-57\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"88.043179\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g2-61\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"97.146747\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g17-71\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"104.267195\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g11-184\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"112.867112\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g17-61\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"119.068848\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g14-57\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"122.32334\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g17-150\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"136.546615\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g0-69\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"143.231551\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g11-187\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"146.897784\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g17-61\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"153.09952\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g14-57\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"159.51985\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g11-106\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"164.678214\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g17-71\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"169.584796\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g11-188\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"176.267443\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g2-61\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"185.371011\" xlink:href=\"#m053_g24-48\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">clean target 昂贵或无法采集</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Acquiring noiseless ground-truth scans (e.g., high-dose CT or long-exposure microscopy) is often clinically unethical or physically impossible.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用同一潜在图像的两次独立、条件无偏 noisy observations 进行监督</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Exploit the statistical property that replacing a clean L2 regression target x with an independent zero-mean noisy target y_2 leaves the optimal Bayes estimator unchanged.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">证明 noisy-to-noisy MSE 与 clean-target MSE 具有相同最优条件均值</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Eliminates the need for clean training targets whenever two independent noisy measurements of static anatomy can be acquired or split.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">可用于拆分 PET counts、MRI k-space 或可重复低剂量测量</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Directly applicable to splitting list-mode PET counts, multi-NEX MRI averages, dose-split CT projections, and cryo-EM / fluorescence microscopy.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">长期有用；独立性、运动和 uptake mismatch 会造成目标偏差</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Enduring mathematical principle; breaks down if inter-scan patient motion occurs or if noise realizations share correlated bias.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">在平方损失下，只要目标噪声条件无偏，noisy target 与 clean target 具有相同的总体最优预测。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">两个观测必须对应同一潜在信号；独立性是去除目标噪声而不学习它的关键。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">Noise2Noise 改变监督数据契约，而不是规定某一种网络主干。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Exploit the statistical property that replacing a clean L2 regression target x with an independent zero-mean noisy target y_2 leaves the optimal Bayes estimator unchanged.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Eliminates the need for clean training targets whenever two independent noisy measurements of static anatomy can be acquired or split.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Equivalence of Expected L2 Risk Under Independent Zero-Mean Noisy Targets E[y_2|x] = x.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可从 PET list-mode 计数拆分、MRI 重复采样或多次低剂量采集构造训练对。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">患者运动、生理变化、造影剂/摄取变化会破坏同一潜在 x 假设，导致解剖或病灶偏差。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Directly applicable to splitting list-mode PET counts, multi-NEX MRI averages, dose-split CT projections, and cryo-EM / fluorescence microscopy.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Enduring mathematical principle; breaks down if inter-scan patient motion occurs or if noise realizations share correlated bias.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.04189\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Noise2Noise: Learning Image Restoration without Clean Data</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/NVlabs/noise2noise\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
